  'hub.lead':'Background information on peptides, quality documentation and research context — without usage recommendations.',
  'hub.c1t':'What are peptides?',
  'hub.c1b':'Peptides are short chains of amino acids — the building blocks of proteins. They occur naturally in the human body and regulate biological processes. In research, synthetically produced peptides are used as tools to understand signaling pathways and investigate cellular mechanisms.',
